{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Fund a national awareness campaign for Clare\u2019s Law",
        "additional_details": "This petition is informed by my own experience. I became aware of Clare's Law only after circumstances had escalated to the point that police involvement was necessary. Had I known that the scheme existed and how accessible it was, I would have sought a disclosure much sooner. \r\n \r\nI believe awareness should not depend on someone already knowing what to search for. Greater public awareness could help people make informed decisions before they are at risk.",
        "background": "I call on the Government to fund a national awareness campaign for Clare\u2019s Law, including working with police forces and public services to promote the scheme so people know that they can request a disclosure if they are considering starting a relationship.",
